{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>連接廣州和深圳的廣深第二高鐵，南延綫將連接北部都會區，有立法會議員認為有助形成更完善的跨境交通格局。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200951-%E5%BB%A3%E6%B7%B1%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E9%AB%98%E9%90%B5%E5%8D%97%E5%BB%B6%E7%B6%AB%E5%B0%87%E9%80%A3%E6%8E%A5%E5%8C%97%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%89%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E8%AA%8D%E7%82%BA%E6%9C%89%E5%8A%A9%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E6%9B%B4%E5%AE%8C%E5%96%84%E8%B7%A8%E5%A2%83%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E6%A0%BC%E5%B1%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>廣深第二高鐵南延綫將連接北都　有議員認為有助形成更完善跨境交通格局</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200939-%E5%BB%A3%E6%B7%B1%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E9%AB%98%E9%90%B5%E6%93%AC%E6%8E%A5%E9%A7%81%E5%8C%97%E9%83%A8%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%83%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%8E%E5%B8%82%E9%82%8A%E7%B7%A3%E5%AE%9A%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%99%E6%9B%B4%E8%91%97%E6%95%B8%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>廣深第二高鐵擬接駁北部都會區？城市邊緣定市中心建站更著數？｜延伸閱讀</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>「粵艇南下」明天首航，海事處已批准至少五艘內地遊艇來港。為確保遊艇來港時的航行安全，會加強巡邏執法。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200942-%E7%B2%B5%E8%89%87%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%8B%E6%B5%B7%E4%BA%8B%E8%99%95%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E8%87%B3%E5%B0%91%E4%BA%94%E8%89%98%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%B0%E9%81%8A%E8%89%87%E4%BE%86%E6%B8%AF%E5%8A%A0%E5%BC%B7%E5%B7%A1%E9%82%8F%E5%9F%B7%E6%B3%95%E7%A2%BA%E4%BF%9D%E8%88%AA%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>粵艇南下｜海事處批准至少五艘內地遊艇來港　加強巡邏執法確保航行安全</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>消委會今年首九個月接獲逾3,000宗涉及客戶服務的投訴，按年升近六成，超越去年全年總數，當中有關人工智能(AI)客服的投訴按年升近1.5倍。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200949-%E6%B6%88%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E6%8E%A5%E7%8D%B2AI%E5%AE%A2%E6%9C%8D%E6%8A%95%E8%A8%B4%E6%8C%89%E5%B9%B4%E5%8D%87%E8%BF%9115%E5%80%8D%E6%8F%90%E9%86%92%E5%95%86%E6%88%B6%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%94%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E8%81%AF%E7%B5%A1%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>消委會接獲AI客服投訴按年升近1.5倍　提醒商戶提供不同且有效聯絡方式</strong></a></p><p></p><p>西醫戴港盛被控新冠疫情期間，濫發新冠疫苗「免針紙」，案件早上在區域法院結案陳詞。被告否認控罪，指是因為對疫苗太快推出而產生疑慮，所以發「免針紙」。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200917-%E8%A5%BF%E9%86%AB%E6%88%B4%E6%B8%AF%E7%9B%9B%E6%B6%89%E6%BF%AB%E7%99%BC%E6%96%B0%E5%86%A0%E7%96%AB%E8%8B%97%E5%85%8D%E9%87%9D%E7%B4%99%E6%A1%88%E7%B5%90%E6%A1%88%E9%99%B3%E8%A9%9E%E6%8A%BC%E5%BE%8C%E8%87%B3%E4%B8%8B%E6%9C%8820%E6%97%A5%E8%A3%81%E6%B1%BA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>西醫戴港盛涉濫發新冠疫苗「免針紙」案結案陳詞　押後至下月20日裁決</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:00:29.684842+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:37:46.807063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T09:57:46.041253+00:00","content_hash":"f300dcee9aa427413d0745ec829665fc394f8e20e1970ff67dec9188b4c2d90b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}